  "limitations": "Order 1..512 and one RHS only. This is not the no-pivot Thomas algorithm used inside an earlier spline pack: adjacent pivots can create a second superdiagonal, which is explicitly retained. Singular zero pivots fail. No cyclic corner entries, SPD specialization, refinement, band matrix generalization or conditioning certificate.",
  "port_notes": "Ports DGTSV forward elimination, its abs(diagonal)>=abs(lower) pivot decision, second-superdiagonal storage and back substitution. Restricts the original NRHS loop to one RHS and returns newly added pivot-decision metadata. The native pinned C translation was executed directly; only the error-handler symbol is stubbed and valid reference cases never invoke it. Full bundled LAPACK BSD license and extra no-patent-reassurance paragraph are preserved.",
